# MASTER DEVELOPMENT SPECIFICATION
# DOJO APP – ADVANCED ADMINISTRATION & BUSINESS MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Upgrade and expand the existing DOJO application by integrating a comprehensive Dojo Business Management System inspired by the operational functionality of AthletaDesk (https://www.athletadesk.com/).

The purpose is to transform DOJO from its current functionality into a complete, interconnected martial arts school management platform.

This is an enhancement of the EXISTING DOJO APPLICATION, NOT a request to create a new application.

The new functionality must be integrated into the existing Admin Section.

IMPORTANT:
- First inspect the entire existing DOJO application.
- Identify its current technology stack, framework, database, backend, API structure, authentication system, existing navigation and design system.
- Inspect all existing Admin pages and existing functionality.
- Identify which modules already exist and which need to be extended.
- Reuse existing components, database tables, authentication, services and design conventions wherever possible.
- Do not duplicate existing functionality.
- Do not remove, overwrite or break existing features.
- Do not replace the existing application architecture unnecessarily.
- Preserve all existing student records and historical data.
- Implement actual working functionality, not merely static visual screens.
- Every new feature must integrate with the existing database and backend.

The finished system must be responsive, professional, fast, secure and suitable for desktop, tablet and mobile use.

